# lemsa_core_kit

- Public API only via `lib/lemsa_core_kit.dart`.
- No message field on `AppFailure`. No empty catches.
- No dio / supabase / firebase / drift / riverpod / auto_route / slang deps.
- Use `fvm flutter` / `fvm dart` (pin 3.35.7). Never upgrade the shared Flutter SDK.
- Do not start page_kit or input_kit unless the user asks.
